WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:02,860
Are you all obedient? Of course

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:05,100
Someone must have hidden a lot of supplies secretly

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,780
But I'm too lazy to pursue it.

4
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,220
We are kind and good citizens of New Zealand.

5
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,720
How can you not leave a way for others to survive? This big brother

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,300
Our entire community except Building 3

7
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:18,020
All the supplies are here, you see

8
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,360
So many things

9
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:23,920
Do you need me to help you move to your home? I'm willing to help, yes, there are many of us.

10
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:26,100
No need to move quickly

11
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,020
My female subordinate can handle it alone.

12
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:29,580
What does it mean

13
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:38,270
How can this person help me move home? If only I had said these things earlier.

14
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:40,150
Can't we just take the cigarettes down and be done with it?

15
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:48,970
I thought you wanted something to eat. Brother, let’s start the building.

16
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:51,250
All the women are here Ning Guomu

17
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:59,720
Cocoa is not even qualified to be my female subordinate. Come and eat.

18
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:02,320
What do those skinny chickens with yellow faces look like?

19
00:01:03,450 --> 00:01:05,410
The boss changed his last name and was so kind.

20
00:01:05,850 --> 00:01:07,450
we can really eat
